window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Silverwood Public: Home to liars, thieves, and worst of all … the Scorpion Kings. </i></b><br> <br> I was the Queen at my old school.<br> Born into wealth and power.<br> Now, thanks to my family’s deceit, I’m a pariah and a target.<br> <br> I’ve got no friends. No parents. No money. And no fucks left to give.<br> <br> If the Scorpion Kings want to damage the new outcast of Silverwood, they’ll soon learn that anyone can be a killer if you give them the right incentive.</p> <p><b><i>*This is a Dark Enemies to Lovers WhyChoose Romance*</i></b><br> <b><i>*Trigger Warning: If you are sensitive to content common in dark romance (content such as SA, graphic depictions of violence, murder, drug and/or alcohol abuse, physical abuse, mental and/or emotional abuse, traumatic events, unhealthy coping mechanisms, dubious consent etc.) then this book may not be for you. Please listen responsibly.*</i></b></p>"; 
